# skills + manual-targeting: the enemy grid refuses a Weapon Break on an enemy whose ATK is already lowered,
# and the name bar marks such an enemy. Jian alone (level index 8, battle MP pinned to 50), first temple
# battle. Round 1: Weapon Break on the second back-row enemy (MP 50 -> 42, one stage to 0xFFFF). Round 2:
# Special, Weapon Break, and the grid opens on that enemy: the name bar reads its name and "ATK" with a down
# triangle (shot rf_tag). A is refused: the bar says "No effect!" (rf_refused), the grid stays, no MP is
# taken. Right moves to another enemy (no tag, rf_other) and A casts on it (second drop to 42, a second
# stage to 0xFFFF). Battle records at 0x0228E860, ATK stage +0x40. Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
include cheats_strong
include warp6
include cheats_strong
pin u32 0x020B4664 8
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
wait 270
watch u32 0x0228E878 jian_mp
watch u16 0x0228EA50 stage4
watch u16 0x0228EABC stage5
watch u16 0x0228EB28 stage6
watch u16 0x0228EC00 stage8
watch u16 0x0228EC6C stage9
watch u16 0x0228ECD8 stage10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 70
press Right 8
wait 20
press A 8
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 8 600
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 110
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 80
shot rf_tag
press A 8
wait 20
shot rf_refused
wait 80
press Right 8
wait 20
shot rf_other
press A 8
wait 250
shot rf_cast
